yu","creatorId":"vndb:s2789","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2789","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2789","name":"高島 洋祐","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:210730","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"佐藤 允紀","creatorId":"vndb:s45284","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s45284","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s45284","name":"佐藤 允紀","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:210731","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c170191","characterName":"ココロ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c170191"},"originalCharacterName":"ココロ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Please make me human.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl humanoid, model number CCR-01."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When the Calamity left the botanical garden in ruins, she was left behind and continued looking after the plants by herself. While she may be indistinguishable from a real human at first glance, she's still an early prototype humanoid. Sometimes her strange behavior and speech patterns betray her true identity. However, she stubbornly insists that she is human."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She always boasts about having a fiancé and believes that he will come to see her when the summer snows, a rare variety of flower in the garden, bloom. After she (re)meets Hinata, she begins to learn about the outside world for the first time."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from English Official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c170191"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ca/caddd149be81c447dad89906aac47915355904a48ffb90585daf8df6a0db6f6a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/57/5727cd25fa32ec3a85720755619080b1cfed10313323f94ad0dc6e456f5a41c7.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"羊宮 妃那","creatorId":"vndb:s39228","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s39228","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s39228","name":"羊宮 妃那","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:99016","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c170192","characterName":"三峯 ひなた","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c170192"},"originalCharacterName":"三峯 ひなた","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"How would you like 'Cocoro' as a name?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A high school boy who grew up in Tsukumo City, a city decimated by the Calamity. As a child, the trauma from losing his mother left him temporarily unable to speak. He often sought refuge at the botanical garden, where he met a mysterious girl and fell in love with her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His relationship with his father, who was the mayor of Tsukumo City at the time, has always been strained. After the Calamity, he was taken in by his aunt, Kirika. He seems mature and composed beyond his years, yet there is a certain world-weariness about him, which likely stems from his childhood experiences."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When he goes to visit his aunt in his hometown during summer break, he's reunited with his first love—the girl who continues to look after the abandoned botanical garden."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from English Official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c170192"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/2396cc6fe96a420555dd2823d4107c7f9730cff7a78436df66231fd5843a07d